      "content": "hey, i'm hitting a massive headache with our jenkins pipeline. we're seeing these intermittent failures during the unit test stage. the code hasn't changed and the tests pass fine locally, but on the build server it just randomly flakes out. sometimes it's a timeout, sometimes it's a weird file permission error. any idea how i can start isolating the environment variables or whatever is causing this non-deterministic behavior?",
